# Streamlit secrets and SSL material
#
# The CERTIFICATE as well as the key. dataviewer/ssl/cert.pem is a real JPL
# TLS certificate; it was being kept out of commits by hand while only
# key.pem was ignored, so a bare `git add -A` would have staged it. It
# identifies a real host and a real organisation, which does not stop being
# true because the private key is absent.
.streamlit/secrets.toml
*/.streamlit/secrets.toml
ssl/
*/ssl/

